Ravi (SDK): i'll add a normalize helper for Retry-After (sec or ms):

```js
function parseRetryAfter(hdr) {
  if (!hdr) return 1000;
  const n = parseInt(hdr, 10);
  if (isNaN(n)) return 1000;
  return n > 1000 ? n : n * 1000; // >1000 -> ms
}
```

